.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.astraplugin
# …except the cross-repo test vectors, which are frozen bytes with their
# expected verdicts and digests recorded beside them (testdata/bundles/README.md).
# They are the deliverable, not build output. Without this line every golden is
# silently absent from the checkout and three suites fail on missing fixtures —
# or, worse, are written to skip when the directory is gone, and pass forever.
!testdata/bundles/*.astraplugin
target/
node_modules/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# `astra-plugin test --report` output, written by CI's conformance job into the
# workspace so the reports can be uploaded as an artifact. Never committed: it is
# a record of one run, and a stale one in the tree would be a conformance claim
# nobody re-derived.
_conformance/
